This repository is a user fork and substantial adaptation of:
  quantskills/skill-pandaai-factor-online

The adapted version is specialized for:
  jingyunzhang1110/factors_lab

Major changes include removal of Codex/Claude/Cursor/Hermes runtime adapters,
replacement of PandaAI-first formula generation with factors_lab canonical AST output,
a bundled 549-factor mother-bank snapshot, strict exact/rank-equivalent deduplication,
and a conservative optional exporter back to PandaAI formula syntax.

The original repository license remains in LICENSE. No endorsement by the upstream
maintainers is implied.
